            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "Want to watch a house being sucked into a black hole?<br />\r\nWant to shoot lasers at a frozen lake?<br />\r\nWant to set off a nuclear bomb with the sole purpose of destroying bees?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the world of Pixel Sand!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere are some buzzwords that our marketing department told us not to use:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 Chapter Campaign  -  wow<br />\r\nSandbox Mode  -  what is that?<br />\r\nNetworked Multiplayer  -  it kinda works<br />\r\nKids Mode  -  let them bash keyboards<br />\r\nProcedurally Generated World Mode  -  oh great another one?<br />\r\nDownloadable Mods  -  lol nerds<br />\r\n________________________________________________________________________<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPixel Sand is a fantasy physics platformer of epic indie proportions. Drawing inspiration from Dan-Ball's Powder Game and other games like Falling Sand, World of Sand, &amp; Powder Toy, we've added to the genre with a familiar player named Vuhrne and a ground breaking story. Solve engaging puzzles and experiment with hundreds of elements as you explore your way through the world in campaign mode, or join a friend and create a universe together that is entirely your own. Share your designs with the world in our online mod community and download mod content for endless hours of entertainment.",
            "about_the_game": "Want to watch a house being sucked into a black hole?<br />\r\nWant to shoot lasers at a frozen lake?<br />\r\nWant to set off a nuclear bomb with the sole purpose of destroying bees?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the world of Pixel Sand!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere are some buzzwords that our marketing department told us not to use:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 Chapter Campaign  -  wow<br />\r\nSandbox Mode  -  what is that?<br />\r\nNetworked Multiplayer  -  it kinda works<br />\r\nKids Mode  -  let them bash keyboards<br />\r\nProcedurally Generated World Mode  -  oh great another one?<br />\r\nDownloadable Mods  -  lol nerds<br />\r\n________________________________________________________________________<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPixel Sand is a fantasy physics platformer of epic indie proportions. Drawing inspiration from Dan-Ball's Powder Game and other games like Falling Sand, World of Sand, &amp; Powder Toy, we've added to the genre with a familiar player named Vuhrne and a ground breaking story. Solve engaging puzzles and experiment with hundreds of elements as you explore your way through the world in campaign mode, or join a friend and create a universe together that is entirely your own. Share your designs with the world in our online mod community and download mod content for endless hours of entertainment.",
            "short_description": "Mix elements like a mad scientist on a particularly spicy date with destiny! Embark on a journey through the mystical caves of Dormacom with our hero Vurhne as he seeks out the ultimate power for no good reason at all!",
