                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very simple, yet very unique platformer that mixes the powder sandbox experience with classic puzzle platforming.\n\nIn this game you have to move your character from one end of the level to the other. There are multiple obstacles on the way, where you have to use the different elements you unlock along the way to clear the path for him. That is essentially what it is. It works pretty well, but it obviously isn’t one of the best indie platformers. I had fun playing this though, especially since it is offered for free.\n__________________\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45534557/]Follow my Curator for more![/url]",
